    cml:logicSummary "Exempts certain offences from attempt liability" ;
    cml:premiseText "(3) Section 11.1 (attempt) does not apply to an offence against:  (a) section 272.14 (procuring child to engage in sexual activity outside Australia); or  (b) section 272.15 (“grooming” child to engage in sexual activity outside Australia); or  (c) section 272.20 (preparing for or planning offence against this Division)." ;
