    cml:modality cml:Deontic ;
    cml:operator "Prohibit" ;
    cml:logicSummary "Prohibits encouraging or aiding a child sexual offence" ;
    cml:premiseText "(4) In this section, encourage means:  (a) encourage, incite to, or urge, by any means whatever, (including by a written, electronic or other form of communication); or  (b) aid, facilitate, or contribute to, in any way whatever." ;
    cml:conclusionText "(4) In this section, encourage means:  (a) not encourage, incite to, or urge, by any means whatever, (including by a written, electronic or other form of communication); or  (b) not aid, facilitate, or contribute to, in any way whatever." ;
    cml:executionSurface "modalities::logic::deontic" ;
    cml:confidence "1.0000"^^xsd:decimal ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .

