concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-sexual-offences-against-children-act-2010-sch-1-sec-273-10-ss-2 cml:asserts concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-sexual-offences-against-children-act-2010-sch-1-sec-273-10-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-4 .
