    cml:modality cml:AllenInterval ;
    cml:operator ">=" ;
    cml:logicSummary "Temporal relation between necessity and public benefit" ;
    cml:premiseText "(2) For the purposes of subsection (1), conduct is of public benefit if, and only if, the conduct is necessary for or of assistance in:  (a) enforcing a law of the Commonwealth, a State or Territory, or a foreign country; or  (b) monitoring compliance with, or investigating a contravention of, a law of the Commonwealth, a State or Territory or a foreign country; or  (c) the administration of justice (whether within or outside Australia);" ;
    cml:conclusionText "The conduct is necessary for or of assistance in enforcing a law." ;
    cml:executionSurface "modalities::interval_reasoning" ;
    cml:confidence "1.0000"^^xsd:decimal ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .


